ress></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>YAMADA YOSHIKO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>DOI, MASAYUKI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YAMADA, YOSHIKO</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A mobile communication terminal for use in mobile communication and mobile satellite communication. The mobile communication terminal comprises a DSP for processing a communication signal in accordance with a communication mode, a CPU for the DSP to operate in the communication mode, and a clock generator for supplying a clock signal to the DSP. The clock generator changes the frequency of the clock signal on the basis of a frequency change request from the DSP according to the communication mode.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>Terminal de communication mobile utilisable dans un système de communication mobile ou dans un système de communication mobile par satellite. Le terminal de communication mobile comprend un traitement numérique du signal (DSP) servant à traiter un signal de communication selon un mode communication, une UCT pour le DSP pouvant fonctionner dans le mode communication, et un générateur d'horloge pour envoyer un signal d'horloge au DSP. Le générateur d'horloge change la fréquence du signal d'horloge en réponse à une demande de changement de fréquence émanant du DSP dans le mode communication.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its form